&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _CUSTOM _DEFINITIONS B-table-Win 
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------

  File:  

  Description: from BROWSER.W - Basic SmartBrowser Object Template

  Input Parameters:
